# Skill Registry — proj

`sdd-*` phase skills are executor contracts. Gentle may skip them as user-invocable skills, but this registry keeps their paths visible so SDD delegation can resolve the existing installed files.

## Skills

| Skill | Trigger / description | Scope | Path |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |

| `sdd-apply` | Apply | executor | `$HOME//.codex/skills/sdd-apply/SKILL.md` |

## Loading protocol

1. Match task context and target files against the `Trigger / description` column.
2. Pass only the matching `Path` values to the subagent under `## Skills to load before work`.
